{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And I will break the pride of your might.</b> Our Sages of blessed memory said (Torat Kohanim): this is the Temple, which is called by this name. And the intention in this is that since they did not repent, this indicates that they think in their minds that HaShem still desires them — from the fact that His sanctuary still dwells among them — and through this they are strengthened. Therefore He said, ״וְשָׁבַרְתִּי״ etc."], :book :leviticus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:02:11.624452860Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}